t;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(250, 219, 20)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;4\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;层\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;冻伤\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e。如果\u003cstrong\u003e飞星\u003c/strong\u003e在场，则使其积累2枚\u003cstrong\u003e「晚星」\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003e可用次数\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;可用次数：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;此牌效果触\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;发后，会消耗1次\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;可用次数\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;；\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;可用次数\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;耗尽后，立刻弃置此牌。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e：2\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"tab_id\":\"1730815724349_0\"}],\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false}","style":""}],"id":"6498","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003ch1 class=\\\"custom-heading-cls\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"\u003e自行巧局\u003c/h1\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"6537","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":true,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"天赋牌","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"card_skill","layout":"","data":"{\"moduleName\":\"天赋牌\",\"layout_\":\"banner\",\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"归芒携信\",\"skill_type\":\"装备牌\",\"icon\":\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2025/10/13/258999284/bf34b0aa7f7664582ddb7eacaf1bd9ca_7610315320855489321.png\",\"life\":3,\"life_bg\":1,\"energy\":0,\"energy_bg\":0,\"desc\":{\"key\":\"天赋效果\",\"value\":[\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cu\u003e战斗行动\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;战斗行动：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;我方执行了一次战斗行动后，会轮到对方行动。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;打出具有此规则的手牌是一个战斗行动，而非快速行动。\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e：我方出战角色为\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e莱依拉\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e时，装备此牌。\u003cbr\u003e莱依拉装备此牌后，立刻使用一次\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e垂裳端凝之夜\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;垂裳端凝之夜：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;元素战技\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;生成\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;安眠帷幕护盾\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;和\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;飞星\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e。\u003cbr\u003e装备有此牌的莱依拉在场时，每当\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e飞星\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\\\"详情\\\" data-name=\\\"\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;飞星：\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;出战状态\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;p\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;我方角色使用技能后：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;累积1枚\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;「晚星」\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;。如果\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;「晚星」\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;已有至少4枚，则消耗4枚\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;「晚星」\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;，造成1点\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(145, 213, 255)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;冰元素伤害\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;。（生成此出战状态的技能，也会触发此效果）\u0026lt;br\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;重复生成此出战状态时：\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;累积2枚\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;「晚星」\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/strong\u0026gt;\u0026lt;span style=\u0026quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\u0026quot;\u0026gt;。\u0026lt;/span\u0026gt;\u0026lt;/p\u0026gt;\\\" class=\\\"wiki-note-text\\\"\u003e\u003csup class=\\\"wiki-sup\\\"\u003e[详情]\u003c/sup\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\\\"\u003e造成伤害，就抓1张牌。\u003cbr\u003e（牌组中包含莱依拉，才能加入牌组）\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\"]},\"tab_id\":\"1759479143814_0\"}],\"baseInfoSwitchDisabled\":false,\"repeated\":true}","style":""}],"id":"8550","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":true,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003ch1 class=\\\"custom-heading-cls\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e天赋牌\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false,\"without_border\":true}\n","style":""}],"id":"8551","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":true,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_e